{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LangGraph的状态图驱动设计\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LangGraph的状态图驱动设计\" dir=\"auto\">LangGraph的状态图驱动设计</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 问题\" dir=\"auto\">1. 问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细解释LangGraph的状态图驱动设计理念，包括其核心概念（StateGraph、Node、Edge）、运行机制，以及为什么它比传统Chain更适合复杂工作流。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.1. 答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LangGraph的核心设计理念</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangGraph是基于<strong>有向状态图（Directed State Graph）</strong>的工作流编排引擎，将工作流建模为图中的节点（Node）和边（Edge），通过状态（State）驱动执行流程。相比传统Chain的线性执行，LangGraph支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>条件分支</strong>：根据状态动态决定执行路径</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>循环</strong>：支持显式循环、隐式循环和Agent自主收敛循环</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>并行执行</strong>：同一超步骤内的节点并行运行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>人工干预</strong>：Human-in-the-loop节点暂停等待人工输入</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>持久化</strong>：状态Checkpoint支持断点恢复</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三大核心组件：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>State（状态）</strong>：全局共享的状态对象，所有节点读写同一个State，实现数据流转</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Node（节点）</strong>：执行单元，接收State并返回State更新片段</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Edge（边）</strong>：连接节点的有向边，分为普通边和条件边（Conditional Edge）</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LangGraph运行机制——超步骤（Super-step）：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">超步骤执行流程：\n1. 激活节点：收到状态更新的节点变为\"活跃状态\"\n2. 执行节点：所有活跃节点并行执行逻辑，生成新的状态片段\n3. 传递消息：新状态片段传递给下一个（或多个）节点，节点回归休眠\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：构建文档处理工作流</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> TypedDict<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> List\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> StateGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> END\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>checkpoint<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> MemorySaver\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 定义状态</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DocState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>TypedDict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    doc_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    raw_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    chunks<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    extracted_meta<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span>\n    confidence<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span>\n    review_decision<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    final_status<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 定义节点函数</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">ingest_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DocState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"文档入库与切片\"\"\"</span>\n    chunks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"raw_text\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>i<span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">500</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"raw_text\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">500</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"chunks\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> chunks<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"final_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ingested\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">llm_extract_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DocState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"LLM信息抽取\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 模拟LLM抽取</span>\n    meta <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"title\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"示例文档\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"keywords\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"AI\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"extracted_meta\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> meta<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"confidence\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.85</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">quality_check_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DocState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"质量检查\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"confidence\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"final_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"needs_review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"final_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"approved\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">human_review_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DocState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"人工审批\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"review_decision\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"approved\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"final_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"reviewed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">write_vector_db_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DocState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"写入向量库\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"final_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"completed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 条件路由函数</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">route_by_quality</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DocState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"confidence\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"approved\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"needs_review\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 构建图</span>\nworkflow <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StateGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>DocState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 添加节点</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"ingest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ingest_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"llm_extract\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm_extract_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"quality_check\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> quality_check_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"human_review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> human_review_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"write_vector_db\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> write_vector_db_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 添加边</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_entry_point<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"ingest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"ingest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"llm_extract\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"llm_extract\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"quality_check\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 条件边：根据质量检查结果路由</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_conditional_edges<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"quality_check\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    route_by_quality<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"approved\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"write_vector_db\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"needs_review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"human_review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"human_review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"write_vector_db\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"write_vector_db\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> END<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 编译并运行</span>\napp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> workflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">compile</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>checkpointer<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>MemorySaver<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 执行</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> app<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"doc_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"doc_001\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"raw_text\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"这是一篇关于AI Agent的技术文档...\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">50</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"configurable\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"thread_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"thread_1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"最终状态: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'final_status'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LangGraph vs 传统Chain对比：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>传统Chain</th>\n<th>LangGraph</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>执行模式</td>\n<td>线性顺序</td>\n<td>任意拓扑（DAG+循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件分支</td>\n<td>需手动编码</td>\n<td>内置Conditional Edge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行</td>\n<td>需额外实现</td>\n<td>超步骤内天然并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工干预</td>\n<td>需外部中断</td>\n<td>内置Human-in-the-loop</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态管理</td>\n<td>手动传递</td>\n<td>全局State自动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断点恢复</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>Checkpoint持久化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.2. 延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：LangGraph的<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">checkpoint</code>机制是如何工作的？有什么应用场景？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：Checkpoint在每个关键步骤后保存完整状态快照，支持流程中断后恢复。适用于长流程任务（如法律合同审核跨越数天）、人工审批场景、容错重试等。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：条件边的路由函数返回值如何映射到下一个节点？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：通过<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">add_conditional_edges</code>的第三个参数是一个字典，将路由函数的返回值映射到对应节点名称。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.3. 常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：LangGraph只适合复杂的Agent工作流。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：LangGraph适用于任何需要精细控制流的场景，从简单的RAG管道到复杂的多Agent协作都可以。对于简单线性流程，传统Chain更轻量。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">2. 相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}